      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Finding software — get it, do not route around it",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-10-09, after an ingest stopped at a missing `tesseract` and the\nagent fed the OCR step a cached copy instead: *\"why no tesseract?\"*, then\n*\"update skills and tools on finding software\"*, *\"github egress\"*, *\"also add\napt\"*. The container is the agent's to provision. Installing took one command\nand twenty seconds; the workaround was the wrong output, quietly.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/finding-software.md#provenance-2",
