      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "When a rung is blocked by the network",
      "prov:value": "Measured from an agent container on 2026-10-09:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/finding-software.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "When a rung is blocked by the network",
      "prov:value": "| route | result |\n|---|---|\n| apt (Ubuntu archive), PyPI, npm | open |\n| `github.com/<o>/<r>/releases/download/<tag>/<asset>` | **200** — the GitHub rung works |\n| `raw.githubusercontent.com` | 200 |\n| `git clone https://github.com/...` | works |\n| `codeload.github.com` archives, `github.com/<o>/<r>/raw/...` | 403 |\n| `api.github.com` | 403 at the time measured (it answered earlier the same day; treat as unreliable — find a tag with `git ls-remote --tags` instead) |"
    }
  ]
